   Dependabot resolves for the oldest Python requires-python allows (3.10) and filters out releases that need a newer one: dnspython 2.9.2 needs Python >=3.11, soupsieve 4.0.0 needs Python >=3.11.5. uv locks them only for the Pythons they support.

